Title: Ferry
Credit: exported by easyscript

# dialogue/ferry.dialogue

## CAPTAIN

.BOARDING - THE DECK

[[The captain greets the player. Keep it short.]]

@THE CAPTAIN
(happy)
Welcome aboard!

@DECKHAND
(tired)
Tickets, please.

@THE CAPTAIN ^
(happy)
Don't mind him.

!The engines rumble.

!— The player chooses:

!— "Show the ticket" (only if has_flag("ticket"))

@DECKHAND
(tired)
All good.

[[do set_flag("boarded")]]

!— "Sneak past"

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry, thinking)
I saw that!

!→ CAUGHT

!— "Leave"

!→ End.

!— (end of choices)

!— If has_flag("boarded"):

@THE CAPTAIN
Enjoy the trip, {{player_name}}.

!— Otherwise:

@THE CAPTAIN
Hm/Well, suit yourself.

!— (end)

!→ CROSSING

.CAUGHT - THE DECK

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry)
Off my *boat*.

!→ End of the conversation.

.CROSSING - THE DECK

!— One of these, at random:

!— 1.

@GULL
Squawk.

!— 2. (weight 2)

@GULL
Squawk squawk.

!— (end)

!— When weather() is "storm":

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry)
Hold on!

!— Otherwise:

@THE CAPTAIN
(calm)
Smooth sailing.

!— (end)

[[set crossed = true]]

!→ End.
